{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storages address their per-type state and the per-entity component bitset by this value."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default implementation assigns indices lazily: the first access of a type takes the next free index"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the process, later accesses look it up in a thread-safe table. The index is process-wide, not per "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so all nexuses of a process agree on it. Indices are dense ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< n"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"},{"type":"text","text":" types used so far) and unbounded."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They depend on the order of first use and are not stable between process launches;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for persistent data.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift has no stored static properties in generic types, so a plain conformance can not cache its index in a static."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Provide your own implementation (the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"type":"text","text":" macro will) as a stored "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static let"},{"type":"text","text":" for a plain load,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but only if you can guarantee that two types never share an index and that it is in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< 1_048_576"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Indices are process-wide: a hand-assigned index must not collide with a lazily assigned one of another type."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"A collision or an index out of range traps at first use of the type in a nexus.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1)","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dense index of this component type."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","role":"symbol","title":"componentIndex","roleHeading":"Type Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentPAAE14componentIndexSivpZ","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component\/componentindex-5oxlf"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"]]},"sectio